{"time": 1751885003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941495544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "大概是回笼觉被打断，泡狐龙也没什么睡意了，于是又下水逛街了"}
{"time": 1751885019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "705557228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(啊，送哪，哇达西天才米粒大，难得难得，)"}
{"time": 1751885036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1817432720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（傻逼）"}
{"time": 1751885221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182529569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这家伙...吸了我好多血。\"皱眉，\"这几天怎么一直在流血，感觉都快贫血了\""}
{"time": 1751885262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869833149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“唔……你想要的话，我也可以给你嘬嘬？”"}
{"time": 1751885342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040297935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶，夏弥也信喝啥补啥吗？\"调整一下姿势躺在她怀里，\"雨幕还不见小啊...\""}
{"time": 1751885356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "488868178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（起码补铁（）"}
{"time": 1751885404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137806905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“想要吹开也不难啦”夏弥挥挥手"}
{"time": 1751885454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777748088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“可是回去也没什么事做，等在这里反而让安感觉，还有一点意义。”"}
{"time": 1751885504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819743642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那……就……打一顿？”"}
{"time": 1751885566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952940809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这下为了高额医药费，不得不去继续抓鸟了（bushi）"}
{"time": 1751885580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074377734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（致敬传奇捕鸟人）"}
{"time": 1751885590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759458500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...这是下下策啦，唉，不过要是下次见面还没变化，那打一顿似乎也可以?\""}
{"time": 1751885591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1443535761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(还真是)"}
{"time": 1751885600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1592786856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还在讲鸟鸟笑话)"}
{"time": 1751885606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060208297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你击飞呢)"}
{"time": 1751885663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173823196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“既然是我们，那似乎任性一点也不是不可以”夏弥伸个懒腰，云层为你裂开一道裂隙"}
{"time": 1751885809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "574285238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样不就成了刚刚劝诫别人不要成为的莽撞的人吗？\"突然笑了，\"但是偶尔任性一回也不错诶，安本来就不是什么知心姐姐，大和抚子。\"站起身，\"决定了，吃了我的鱼，一定要揍它一顿。\""}
{"time": 1751885966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601162917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（厉害（）"}
{"time": 1751885976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1873830966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是之后再来吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1751886105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839788089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（择日不如撞日）"}
{"time": 1751886128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1826775517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（先打一拳，打的时候再问问题）"}
{"time": 1751886220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737145130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "泡狐龙的踪迹自然不算难寻，方才下水，顺着涟漪找便是"}
{"time": 1751886258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968373572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "顺着涟漪，追着这家伙的踪迹"}
{"time": 1751886388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "404617093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1826775517]（豪p[CQ:at,qq=1252219916]"}
{"time": 1751886396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "557392982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "它游荡一会，在湖中的一隅小岛出上岸，惬意地打个哈欠"}
{"time": 1751886408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524627774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=404617093]（这是蔚的台词）"}
{"time": 1751886415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533112652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你不是玩蔚的？）"}
{"time": 1751886457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1585216080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（差不多）"}
{"time": 1751886463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1820999640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（男拳和女拳）"}
{"time": 1751886483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045985443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“总感觉有点不爽。”瞪了它一眼，“夏弥，揍它”"}
{"time": 1751886594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693939978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“揍到什么程度？”夏弥右掌心凝出一块肉眼可见的风团"}
{"time": 1751886603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "639103688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那不就是）"}
{"time": 1751886605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962447072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（螺旋丸）"}
{"time": 1751886721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "202737591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"眯着眼睛，\"打到它不敢发怒为止。\""}
{"time": 1751886895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1603513555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "似乎是察觉到来自天空的威胁，泡狐龙本能地抬头，发出惊疑不定的吼叫"}
{"time": 1751886990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "188245701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=202737591]“不错，和我想的差不多”于是夏弥也眯了眯眼，挥手一扬，风弹便电射而下，砸在泡狐龙的颈根"}
{"time": 1751887032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247892354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "仗着身处天空，也有样学样搓个风球轰击它"}
{"time": 1751887033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "784153555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd"}
{"time": 1751887033, "type": "reply", "message_id": "784153555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[天宫安]演奏出: 1D20=15"}
{"time": 1751887175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224775507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "两道风弹一大一小，一前一后，流星赶月般轰在泡狐龙身上，顿时砸得鳞片飞溅，血光迸射，弓起的身子也不得不矮了下去"}
{"time": 1751887275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451554681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“哼。”哼一声，舒了口气"}
{"time": 1751887321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2120430469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不过作为一方水系王侯，它的脾气远比外观看上去硬。它不屈地挣脱风的压迫，头鳍和眼睛骤然充血变红，仰首就是一根水线射来"}
