{"time": 1751894262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1238275979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "医生的姓是蝴蝶，名字很少有人知道，也没什么人这么叫她。你进来前她正在抓药，听到你的话后，她把药柜推回，转过头来看了一眼"}
{"time": 1751894314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "554568635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她受了好重的伤，还淋了好久好久的雨，快救救她吧”"}
{"time": 1751894347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831355994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这是？”她说话很干脆，动作更干脆，话音未落已经从柜台后面绕了出来"}
{"time": 1751894426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929786406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她简单看了一眼情况，又撩起湿透的绷带，显然绷带已经和伤口沾在了一起，染上血浆的橙红色"}
{"time": 1751894435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699831443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她应该还有救吧...”"}
