{"time": 1751896100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145971406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“失温...那该怎么办，有什么我能帮上忙的地方吗”"}
