{"time": 1751896214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2103089916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“收...”迅速捂住嘴，然后去取绷带"}
{"time": 1751896329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1520125737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你回来的时候，蝴蝶正在把那一团团的药膏往她的伤口上涂抹均匀。下手并不轻，你能看见那高个子女人的眉头紧皱"}
{"time": 1751896483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742459783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "尽快涂抹完后，她从你手上抢过绷带，裁成一条条一掌余宽的窄块，糊在药膏上，随后用胶带简单地固定"}
{"time": 1751896554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500033619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "随后她温好一缸热水，把那女人侧翻过来，对你努努嘴“过来帮忙，你托着她的腿，搬到缸里去”"}
{"time": 1751896598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799389996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“别让伤口沾到水”"}
