{"time": 1751907570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2067418689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔……呼吸好像变重了”"}
{"time": 1751907657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1185388402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是吗？要醒了?\"感叹一下，\"我的血这么好用吗？\"起身看着"}
{"time": 1751907765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30283182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "粉发女人的肤色依旧白得吓人，甚至于看着有些干瘪，但手指确实是动了动"}
{"time": 1751907830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261302595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "靠近一些瞧一瞧，手指戳戳脸"}
{"time": 1751907881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129705911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "没什么弹性的样子"}
{"time": 1751907903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853309762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+6-2"}
{"time": 1751907903, "type": "reply", "message_id": "853309762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]演奏出: d+6-2={16}+6-2=20"}
{"time": 1751907992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "805924683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好没弹性啊，夏弥。\"收回手指戳戳夏弥的脸"}
{"time": 1751908079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1509812120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "下一瞬间，躺在地上的某龙身型暴起，还没睁开眼，几近破碎的长刀就在右手中成型，随后肩膀带动胳膊，继而传动到手腕，朝着夏弥劈去"}
{"time": 1751908093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "111417043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+6-4"}
{"time": 1751908093, "type": "reply", "message_id": "111417043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]演奏出: d+6-4={12}+6-4=14"}
{"time": 1751908133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1445272050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“小心——”夏弥一只手拉开挡在二人之间、还背对着泡狐龙的你"}
{"time": 1751908140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695153200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+8-2 格挡"}
{"time": 1751908140, "type": "reply", "message_id": "695153200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]使用[格挡]演奏出:[d+8-2={8}+8-2=14]"}
{"time": 1751908210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341530105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶！\"立刻反应过来，抽出长剑，看一眼夏弥的伤势"}
{"time": 1751908279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103766493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "好在夏弥在听到她有所动静之后便有了防备，金属化的右臂挡下长刀，只留下淡淡的白痕。而泡狐龙那精致如裂纹陶瓷的长刀却彻底支撑不住，轻轻地碎掉了"}
{"time": 1751908316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375903908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "旋即，泡狐龙人再度陷入昏迷"}
{"time": 1751908375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711549698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这家伙。\""}
{"time": 1751908392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1975952075", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哈基狐，你这句话……）"}
{"time": 1751908401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909397070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哈基狐，你这家伙……）"}
{"time": 1751908432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "414991905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "心疼地揉一揉夏弥的右手臂，随后蹲下来狠狠地掐泡狐的脸"}
{"time": 1751908460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800114893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我没事……”夏弥甩了甩右手“不过这家伙还真是不死心”"}
{"time": 1751908480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374378188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不得不说，还挺厉害的”"}
{"time": 1751908489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811586999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"感觉这么带着上路的话，这种事还要遇到好几次。\"皱着眉"}
{"time": 1751908544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516671390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还是在这里处理好吧。\"把她的手绑起来，坐在一边，把早就准备好的烤鱼递给夏弥，\"我们先吃鱼吧，这家伙待会再管。\""}
{"time": 1751908561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "490492785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那感觉你们今天都回不去了）"}
{"time": 1751908568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177524805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可以跳到第二天了）"}
